:"OSINT for CTF: Public Data to Flag",slug:"osint-for-ctf",description:"OSINT for CTF: identify a CVE from a prose description, recover redacted text, geolocate from EXIF, read identity out of a pcap, and profile credentials.",date:"2026-08-25",tags:["osint","forensics","general-skills","metadata"],sources:[{name:"CVE-2021-34527 (Windows Print Spooler Remote Code Execution Vulnerability)",url:"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2021-34527",publisher:"CVE Program, MITRE"},{name:"CVE-2021-1675 (Windows Print Spooler Remote Code Execution Vulnerability)",url:"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2021-1675",publisher:"CVE Program, MITRE"},{name:"Security Update Guide: CVE-2021-34527",url:"https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2021-34527",publisher:"Microsoft Security Response Center"},{name:"VU#383432: Microsoft Windows Print Spooler allows for RCE via AddPrinterDriverEx()",url:"https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/383432",publisher:"CERT Coordination Center"},{name:"Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog",url:"https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog",publisher:"CISA"},{name:"Common Vulnerability Scoring System v3.1: Specification Document",url:"https://www.first.org/cvss/v3.1/specification-document",publisher:"FIRST"},{name:"Scalable Vector Graphics (SVG) 1.1: Text",url:"https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/text.html",publisher:"W3C"},{name:"ExifTool by Phil Harvey",url:"https://exiftool.org/",publisher:"Phil Harvey"},{name:"BEP 3: The BitTorrent Protocol Specification",url:"https://www.bittorrent.org/beps/bep_0003.html",publisher:"BitTorrent.org"},{name:"Aircrack-ng documentation",url:"https://www.aircrack-ng.org/doku.php?id=aircrack-ng",publisher:"Aircrack-ng project"},{name:"NIST SP 800-63B-4: Digital Identity Guidelines, Authentication and Authenticator Management",url:"https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-4/sp800-63b.html",publisher:"NIST"}]}].map(e=>{let t=e.slug||(0,n.slugify)(e.title);return{...e,slug:t}}).sort((e,t)=>t.date.localeCompare