d segment detached and drifting away from the other two.","cryptography-roadmap":"Seven stepped platforms rising left to right, each carrying a different small cryptographic object.","csrf-for-ctf":"A small page pushing a blank card into a cabinet slot, with a round disc riding along on the card.","ctf-encodings":"Four concentric rings opened along one side, revealing a small solid core at the centre.","ctf-environment-setup":"An overhead workbench tray of fitted tool recesses beside a small sealed container box.","ctf-steganography":"Two identical panels, one with a surface layer peeled back to reveal a fine dot pattern beneath.","custom-cipher-reversing-ctf":"Three identical probes entering a sealed box and three differently shaped pieces coming out.","custom-vm-reversing-ctf":"A featureless machine cabinet with a perforated strip feeding into a small reading head.","diffie-hellman-ctf":"Two paths passing through separate mixing vessels and converging on one shared vessel.","disk-forensics-ctf":"A cutaway of six stacked disk layers with a probe descending to a small pocket in the lowest one.","document-forensics-ctf":"An opaque bar lifted at one corner off a plate, revealing engraved grooves continuing underneath.","elliptic-curves-ctf":"A smooth curve with two points at the same height, whose construction lines meet at one node below.","esoteric-languages-ctf":"Four differently built hoppers whose separate ducts merge into one shared outlet spout.","exif-metadata-forensics-ctf":"A picture frame turned face-down, with a small blank tag plate lifted from its backing board.","file-carving-magic-bytes-ctf":"A ribbon of joined blocks with a broken leading block and a machined replacement held above it.","file-upload-exploitation":"A picture frame whose lower third opens into a mechanical hatch with a gear turning inside.","forensics-roadmap":"A single thick trunk splitting into five branches, each ending in a differently shaped cap.","format-string-ctf":"A hopper drawing plates out of a stack, with one plate travelling back into the stack instead.","frida-binary-instrumentation-ctf":"A drive belt between two pulleys with a clamp fastened mid-run, tapping a line to a collecting cup.","gdb-ctf-guide":"Three meshed gears stopped by a wedge pin, with an inspection lens held over the stopped teeth.","general-skills-roadmap":"Five slender pillars of different heights standing on one broad low plinth.","ghidra-reverse-engineering":"A dense band of tiny marks passing through a lens plate and emerging as four large clean blocks.","git-forensics-ctf":"A node graph with one main line and four detached nodes floating unconnected around it.","go-rust-reversing-ctf":"An enormous solid slab with one shallow drawer pulled out, holding a row of small blank tabs.","graphql-exploitation-ctf":"A small port in a blank panel from which a large branching lattice of nodes unfolds.","hash-cracking-ctf":"Assorted shapes funnelled into identical fixed-length bars, with one bar held beside a target bar.","hash-length-extension-ctf":"A chain of identical links ending in an open coupling where more links are being added.","heap-exploitation-ctf":"Five boxes threaded together on a shelf, with the thread veering off to a sixth box standing apart.","hex-dumps-ctf":"A dense grid of uniform blank squares with a short run of four different squares at the top left.","how-to-start-ctf":"A simple gate opening onto a path that fans out into six separate trails.","http-for-ctf":"A blank card travelling a rail between two cabinets while a tool folds down one of its corners.","insecure-deserialization-ctf":"A flat-packed object unfolding, with a small toothed mechanism already turning inside the last panel.","insecure-randomness-ctf":"A strip of irregular tiles with a machine on the right stamping out tiles that match them exactly.","integer-overflow-ctf":"A notched counter drum whose follower arm has passed the top notch and reappeared at the bottom.","java-reverse-engineering-ctf":"An opened archive crate with its contents laid out as blank plates beneath an index comb.","javascript-deobfuscation-ctf":"A tangled mass of thread narrowing into one small nozzle, with a tray placed under it.","lfi-for-ctf":"A staircase leading up out of a shallow walled enclosure, with one file plate carried back down it.","linux-cli-ctf":"A rail with five tool heads in sequence, a ribbon passing through them and leaving narrow and clean.","linux-privilege-escalation-ctf":"Four mismatched makeshift steps bridging a low platform up to a much higher ledge.","modular-arithmetic-ctf":"A large notched dial with two hands, the longer one having swept past the top and continued round.","netcat-ctf-guide":"A single cable ending in a plug seated in one socket on a large featureless panel.","networking-tools-ctf":"A patch panel with four different cables plugged in, gathering into a single heavy bundle.","nosql-injection-ctf":"A narrow card slot in a plate with a bulky irregular object passing straight through it.","osint-for-ctf":"Two identical record cards side by side, a caliper resting on the one small field that differs on the right card.","padding-oracle-cbc-ctf":"A sealed block with a row of sixteen shutters, one open, beside a two-state indicator lamp.","php-type-juggling-ctf":"A balance beam reading level with a solid cube in one pan and a hollow open frame in the other.","picoctf-2026-guide":"A wide sorting plate of seven unequal bays holding blank tiles, with one tile lifted clear.","picoctf-beginners-guide":"A large map board on a plinth showing a blank route grid with one marker pin in a corner.","pwntools-for-ctf":"An open fitted case with four cut recesses, each holding a precisely sized tool.","python-for-ctf":"A hand-cranked machine stamping the same operation onto every segment of a strip.","python-reversing-ctf":"A sealed capsule split in half, revealing a stacked deck of thin plates with the top one lifted.","python-sandbox-bypass-ctf":"A wall with a fine mesh grate, and a narrow channel running under the footing to bypass it.","race-conditions-toctou-ctf":"An inspection machine gauging an empty seat while a second plate slides into it along a rail.","radare2-rizin-ctf":"A blank console panel with one caret block, unspooling a long ribbon of narrow bands.","recipe-chain-ctf":"Four filter modules bolted in series, a tangle entering the top and one clean shape leaving the bottom.","ret2libc-ctf":"A floating slab of shelves pinned by a taut measuring line from a fixed anchor, with an arrow on one shelf.","reverse-engineering-roadmap":"Five stepped platforms rising left to right, each carrying a different reverse-engineering instrument.","rop-chain-without-libc":"A ladder spanning a gap, each rung made from a different salvaged scrap piece.","rsa-attacks-ctf":"A large rectangle split into two unequal halves, the gap between them shaped like a keyhole.","side-channel-attacks-ctf":"A sealed box with a shuttered output port, beside a gauge needle tracing a wavering line on a drum.","smart-contract-ctf-bugs":"A vault whose payout chute loops all the way round and feeds back into its own request slot.","sql-injection-ctf":"A rail track with switch points thrown, diverting a cart into the open side of a records cabinet.","sqlmap-for-ctf":"An automated arm on a rail pulling one drawer open from a cabinet of identical closed drawers.","srop-ret2dlresolve-ctf":"A machined pin rack taking a blank forged plate, with one lever that sets every pin at once.","ssrf-for-ctf":"A gateway whose fetching arm reaches outward, curls back and enters its own inner courtyard.","ssti-template-injection-ctf":"A stencil plate with a shaped cut-out, a small cog entering and a much larger one leaving.","stack-canary-bypass-ctf":"A corridor with a taut tripwire across it and a side alcove allowing a path around it.","steganography-tools":"A pegboard of six hanging instruments with one lifted off, held before a plain image plate.","stream-ciphers-in-ctfs":"Two textured ribbons overlapping, the overlapping band cancelling to plain empty ground.","usb-hid-pcap-forensics-ctf":"A blank keycap slab cabled to a spool, unrolling a strip of report blocks that reassembles into keycaps.","use-after-free-ctf":"A thread still tied above an empty pedestal slot that a different, newer box now occupies.","volatility-3-ctf-memory-forensics":"A memory module sliced into thin layers with one layer drawn out, a small structure on its face.","web-challenges-real-world-bug-patterns":"A small structure and a much larger one built from exactly the same repeated modular block.","web-exploitation-roadmap":"Eight stepped platforms rising left to right, each carrying a different web-exploitation object.","web-recon-ctf":"A plain building front with everything shut, and an open service hatch in the pavement before it.","webassembly-reversing-ctf":"A sealed module linked to a tall plate stack where a mechanical arm pushes one plate onto the top.","what-is-picoctf":"A shallow ramp of stacked slabs rising from a field of loose unsorted slabs, with one slab seated into place at its foot.","windows-forensics-ctf":"A four-pane window frame laid flat as a tray, a caliper lifting an object out of one pane.","wireshark-pcap-ctf":"Drifting packet blocks in parallel lanes with one thread woven through them into a tidy ribbon.","x86-64-shellcode-ctf":"A short strip of twenty-three machined blocks on a rule, one of them hollow instead of solid.","x86-assembly-for-ctf":"A rack of blank register plates beside a plate stack, with one curved arrow looping back to the rack.","xor-for-ctf":"Two overlapping textured squares whose lens-shaped overlap is completely clean and empty.","xss-for-ctf":"Two identical screen frames, a foreign cog dropped into one and an identical cog turning in the other.","xxe-for-ctf":"A folded document with a jointed tendril reaching into a filing cabinet and drawing out one plate.","z3-solver-for-ctf":"Five irregula